@startuml View List of Users by Admin
actor Admin
participant ": UserManagementPage " as UserManagementPage
participant ": Router " as Router
participant ": AuthController " as AuthController
participant ": AuthService " as AuthService
participant ": UserRepository " as UserRepository
participant ": PaginationService " as PaginationService
database Database

Admin->UserManagementPage: 1. Navigate to User Management page
    activate Admin
    activate UserManagementPage

UserManagementPage->UserManagementPage: 2. Render User Management Page

UserManagementPage->Router: 3. Send GET /api/users?pageNumber={pageNumber}&pageSize={pageSize}&search={search}&status={status}&role={role}&sortField={sortField}&sortDirection={sortDirection}
    deactivate UserManagementPage
    activate Router

Router->AuthController: 4. Route Request to Controller
    deactivate Router
    activate AuthController

AuthController->AuthService: 5. GetAllUsersAsync(paginationRequest)
    deactivate AuthController
    activate AuthService

AuthService->UserRepository: 6. GetQueryable()
    activate UserRepository

UserRepository->Database: 7. Query Users with StudentProfile and TeacherProfile
    activate Database

Database-->UserRepository: 8. Return Users query with relations
    deactivate Database

UserRepository-->AuthService: 9. Return IQueryable<User>
    deactivate UserRepository

AuthService->AuthService: 10. Apply filters (status, role), search and sort

AuthService->PaginationService: 11. GetPagedResultAsync(query, paginationRequest)
    activate PaginationService

PaginationService->Database: 12. Count total and Apply pagination
    activate Database

Database-->PaginationService: 13. Return paginated Users with totalCount
    deactivate Database

PaginationService-->AuthService: 14. Return PagedResult<User>
    deactivate PaginationService

AuthService->AuthService: 15. Map to UserDto[]

AuthService-->AuthController: 16. Return PaginationResponseDto<UserDto>
    activate AuthController
    deactivate AuthService

AuthController-->Router: 17. Send User List Response
    activate Router
    deactivate AuthController

Router-->UserManagementPage: 18. Display User List
    activate UserManagementPage
    deactivate Router

UserManagementPage->UserManagementPage: 19. Render User Information

UserManagementPage-->Admin: 20. Show Complete User List
    deactivate UserManagementPage
    deactivate Admin
@enduml




